{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中村麗乃です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ9M5XQB84SB1W6JSTFYQ97","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏の空が大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗な真っ青な空に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太陽のきらきらした光が差して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても明るい気持ちになれるから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のサイリウムカラーも青と白のお空色！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな色なのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっでもね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方の空はもっと好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ9M6Y66XQYVSWGFZNKN4DW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌なことも全部忘れさせてくれる大切な時間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでまた、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からも頑張ろうって気持ちにしてくれる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のオーディションを受けていたのも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6年前の今頃でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏になると、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自然とその頃の事ををよく思い出します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場付近には可愛い女の子たちがいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、きっとあの子もオーディション行くんだろうな、とかって思いながら\nそわそわしていたのを思い出します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お見立て会の自己PRで\nドレミの歌の替え歌みたいなのをやったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの頃はそれすらもまともに歌えてなかったわたしです…笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして月日は経ち、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ではライブで沢山お歌のコーナーを任せて頂いたり\n舞台やミュージカルもさせて頂いています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当時のことを考えたら信じられないですよね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が1番びっくりしてます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、嬉しい。とっても！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今も得意です！とは言えないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌うことも演じる事も大好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10年前の自分は\nこんなに素敵な人たちに出会って\nこの場所にいるなんて\n想像もしていませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーも楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ9M7WX6XDWXHJHH78E4HE0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生、何があるかわからないものです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ眠る可能性、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしも見つけられるかな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つけてもらいたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中村麗乃"}],"source":"archive"}